---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Poetry Submissions Directory">
	<main class="about-container">
		<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Directory</a>
		
		<h1>About This Tool</h1>
		
		<div class="content-block">
			<p>This site is updated dynamically (ie automatically, using not very polished code), and not very thoroughly. Poetry magazines are *terrible* at providing structured information about when they're accepting submissions, so lots of magazines will quite likely remain as 'Unknown' permanently, and some of those listed as 'Open' or 'Closed' will be innacurate. The statuses (Open, Closed, Soon) are checked roughly once a week to ensure you are always looking at actionable information.</p>
			
			<h2>How to Use This List, Though, In Theory</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Open:</strong> They are currently accepting unsolicited submissions. Check their guidelines for specific formatting rules.</li>
				<li><strong>Closed:</strong> Their reading window is currently shut.</li>
				<li><strong>Soon:</strong> They have an upcoming submission window opening shortly.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>If you run a magazine and need your details updated, or if you spot an error – or if you'd like to help out, or if you have ideas of how to improve things – please feel free to email me on poetrysubssite@gmail.com.</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-container {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 0;
	}

	.back-link {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		color: #555;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		color: #000;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	p, li {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #333;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	ul {
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
</style>